data: {"event_id":"01M2ST2EQKFYGRVK00WXPSQKBY","run_id":"8d3cdea1-99b6-2e60-1001-9fd13d044ed5","tenant_id":"0","session_id":"33cb3985-e16c-2f8f-3f45-80f6c62cb277","config_id":"f039a8d2-f0b7-5edf-4818-e5fdf3d38490","timestamp":"2026-09-18T08:28:03.187267573Z","seq":716,"source_event_id":"prt_4c1c585ef8755df02c48db6d","source_event_type":"message.part.updated","type":"run.tool_call_started","data":{"tool_call_id":"prt_4c1c585ef8755df02c48db6d","name":"bash","input":{"command":"cat \u003e /tmp/summary.txt \u003c\u003c'TXT'\nThe POST handler had no title validation, so missing or whitespace-only titles were accepted with 201. Added a guard that returns 400 with an error mentioning title when the field is missing or blank. Regression tests pass — 8 pass with `npm test`.\nTXT\n\npython3 -c \"\nimport json,sys\nprint(json.dumps({\n  'ticket':  sys.argv[1],\n  'author':  'fixer',\n  'status':  'pr_opened',\n  'pr_url':  sys.argv[2],\n  'body':    open('/tmp/summary.txt').read().strip(),\n}))\" \"TF-104\" \"https://github.com/dcabrejas/mars-ticket-to-pr-taskflow/pull/3\" \u003e /tmp/callback.json\n\ncurl -sS -X POST \"$CONSOLE_URL/api/agent/callback\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $CONSOLE_TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  --data-binary @/tmp/callback.json","description":"Report back to TaskFlow board","timeout":15000}}}

